            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅 @ 点名发言"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅单聊生效，最多 3 个备用模型。尚未收到正文或思考时，HTTP 429/502/503/504 或网络超时会按顺序切换；已输出、鉴权错误、内容拦截和取消不会切换。上下文及启用的记忆会发给备用服务商，每次尝试独立记账。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Single chat only, with up to 3 backup models. Before any text or reasoning arrives, HTTP 429/502/503/504 or a network timeout tries backups in order. Partial output, authentication errors, content filtering and cancellation never trigger a switch. Context and enabled memories are sent to the backup provider; every attempt is recorded separately."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅单聊生效，最多 3 个备用模型。尚未收到正文或思考时，HTTP 429/502/503/504 或网络超时会按顺序切换；已输出、鉴权错误、内容拦截和取消不会切换。上下文及启用的记忆会发给备用服务商，每次尝试独立记账。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅在你首次确认数据出境/第三方传输披露后，你主动发送的会话上下文、所选附件、已启用的个人记忆或联网搜索关键词才会从你的设备直接发送至你所配置的模型 API 地址（如 OpenAI、Anthropic、Google Gemini、DeepSeek、OpenRouter、Tavily 或局域网服务）。相关数据的留存与使用受对应服务商自身的隐私条款约束。你可随时在本页点击「撤回发送授权」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only after you confirm the third-party data disclosure will your active conversation context, selected attachments, enabled personal memories, or web search queries be sent directly from your device to the API endpoints you configured (such as OpenAI, Anthropic, Google Gemini, DeepSeek, OpenRouter, Tavily, or LAN services). Retention and use of sent data are governed by each provider's own privacy policy. You can revoke permission here at any time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在你首次确认数据出境/第三方传输披露后，你主动发送的会话上下文、所选附件、已启用的个人记忆或联网搜索关键词才会从你的设备直接发送至你所配置的模型 API 地址（如 OpenAI、Anthropic、Google Gemini、DeepSeek、OpenRouter、Tavily 或局域网服务）。相关数据的留存与使用受对应服务商自身的隐私条款约束。你可随时在本页点击「撤回发送授权」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅在您点击上方按钮时读取一次剪贴板，自动提取常见服务商（OpenAI / DeepSeek / Claude / Gemini / OpenRouter / 中转站）的地址与密钥。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reads your clipboard once only when you tap above, extracting endpoints and API keys for common providers (OpenAI, DeepSeek, Claude, Gemini, OpenRouter, or custom gateways)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在您点击上方按钮时读取一次剪贴板，自动提取常见服务商（OpenAI / DeepSeek / Claude / Gemini / OpenRouter / 中转站）的地址与密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
