    "发送前打开「联网搜索」并确认搜索词。只把该搜索词发给 Tavily，不发送记忆、附件或聊天历史；来源摘要会发给回答模型。搜索可能消耗 Tavily 额度，费用不计入模型 Token 费用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enable Web Search and review the query before sending. Only that query is sent to Tavily; memories, attachments and chat history are excluded. Source snippets are sent to the answering model. Searches may use Tavily credits, billed separately from model tokens."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发送前打开「联网搜索」并确认搜索词。只把该搜索词发给 Tavily，不发送记忆、附件或聊天历史；来源摘要会发给回答模型。搜索可能消耗 Tavily 额度，费用不计入模型 Token 费用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
