            "value": "只带入人物和原书资料。群聊单独保存阅读进度和聊天记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只应用于新对话。助手绑定的知识库可在每次发送前关闭。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applies to new chats. You can skip the assistant’s knowledge sources for an individual message."
          }
