    "多个 API Key 会按轮询（Round-Robin）分摊请求；当某个 Key 返回 429 限流、401/402/403 鉴权或余额不足时将自动冷却并秒切下一个 Key。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Multiple API keys share load via round-robin; any key hitting 429 rate limits or 401/402/403 quota errors cools down and fails over to the next key."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "多个 API Key 会按轮询（Round-Robin）分摊请求；当某个 Key 返回 429 限流、401/402/403 鉴权或余额不足时将自动冷却并秒切下一个 Key。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
