    "对话回复由你接入的第三方人工智能模型生成，可能存在虚构或滞后信息，仅供参考，不构成专业医疗、法律或投资建议。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Responses are generated by third-party AI models you connect and may contain inaccuracies or outdated information. They are for reference only and do not constitute medical, legal or financial advice."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
