    "将使用 AES-GCM 加密导出所有对话、服务商自定义地址及 API Key。请设置至少 8 位密码并妥善保管，遗忘后无法恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exports all chats, custom provider URLs, and API keys encrypted with AES-GCM. Set a password of at least 8 characters and keep it safe — it cannot be recovered if forgotten."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将使用 AES-GCM 加密导出所有对话、服务商自定义地址及 API Key。请设置至少 8 位密码并妥善保管，遗忘后无法恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将删除「%@」及其所有消息和草稿。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” and all its messages and drafts will be deleted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将删除「%@」及其所有消息和草稿。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将删除本地保存的 WebDAV 地址、账号及钥匙串中的密码和同步加密密钥，不会影响云端已有文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Removes your local WebDAV URL, username, password, and encryption passphrase from Keychain. Files on the server remain untouched."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将删除本地保存的 WebDAV 地址、账号及钥匙串中的密码和同步加密密钥，不会影响云端已有文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将原问题、相关上下文及 %lld 条完整答案发送给所选裁判，产生一次额外请求。失败、取消和截断的答案不参与。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The original question, relevant context and %lld complete answers will be sent to the selected judge in an additional request. Failed, cancelled and truncated answers are excluded."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将原问题、相关上下文及 %lld 条完整答案发送给所选裁判，产生一次额外请求。失败、取消和截断的答案不参与。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将发送哪些数据": {
      "localizations": {
