            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将移除「%@」及其保存在本机钥匙串中的 API Key 与敏感请求头。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将移除所有分支中的 %lld 条消息及其附件。可以在此页面撤销，也可以从已有备份恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This removes %lld messages across all branches, including their attachments. You can undo this here or restore from an existing backup."
