            "value": "我想真正吃透 Swift Concurrency 的 Actor 隔离机制，请用苏格拉底式提问引导我。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我想真正吃透下面这个概念/技能，请用苏格拉底启发式提问引导我逐步思考，先不要直接揭晓答案：\n\n": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Help me deeply master the following concept or skill using Socratic questioning — guide me step by step without giving away the answer upfront:\n\n"
