    "按服务商、模型和请求类型分组。首段包含思考；正文为首个正文片段。速度仅统计完整流式回复，用 API 返回的输出 Token 除以首末输出间隔，可能包含思考 Token。不同提示词和输入长度会影响结果。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grouped by provider, model and request type. First output includes reasoning; first answer measures answer text. Speed uses only completed streams: API-reported output tokens divided by the interval between first and last output, possibly including reasoning tokens. Prompts and input lengths affect results."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按服务商、模型和请求类型分组。首段包含思考；正文为首个正文片段。速度仅统计完整流式回复，用 API 返回的输出 Token 除以首末输出间隔，可能包含思考 Token。不同提示词和输入长度会影响结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按服务商返回用量与已设单价（含缓存单价快照）估算，不含阶梯价格和额外收费。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estimated from provider-reported usage and saved prices (including cache price snapshots); excludes tiered pricing and extra fees."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按服务商返回用量与已设单价（含缓存单价快照）估算，不含阶梯价格和额外收费。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
