    "提示词缓存可显著降低 Anthropic 长上下文与系统提示词成本；智能工具仅在单聊生效，记忆建议需经你手动确认后才会保存。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prompt caching reduces long-context and system prompt costs on supported providers. Agent tools apply to single chat only, and memory suggestions require your confirmation before saving."
