            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When no Tavily key is set, tapping Web in the composer or enabling Provider-Native Web Search in Send Options requests built-in grounding (Gemini Google Search, Anthropic Web Search, OpenAI / OpenRouter Web Search), falling back automatically if unsupported."
