    "请从以下内容中提炼核心结论、待办行动项与关键时间节点：\n\n": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Distill the core conclusions, actionable to-do items, and key deadlines from the following:\n\n"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请从以下内容中提炼核心结论、待办行动项与关键时间节点：\n\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请充当我的私教分步讲解这道题/这部分内容：先指出核心考点与思路，再逐步推导，最后点明易错点：\n\n": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Please act as my tutor and explain this problem step by step: identify key concepts and approach first, show each step clearly, and call out common pitfalls:\n\n"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请充当我的私教分步讲解这道题/这部分内容：先指出核心考点与思路，再逐步推导，最后点明易错点：\n\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请先在「服务商 → 联网搜索」配置 Tavily API Key。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configure a Tavily API key in Providers → Web Search first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先在「服务商 → 联网搜索」配置 Tavily API Key。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请先在「服务商」页面为「%@」配置 API Key（本地服务若免鉴权可忽略）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add an API key for “%@” on the Providers tab first (not needed for local services without auth)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先在「服务商」页面为「%@」配置 API Key（本地服务若免鉴权可忽略）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请先在「服务商」页面启用服务商并添加模型。你输入的内容已保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enable a provider and add models on the Providers tab first. Your message has been kept."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先在「服务商」页面启用服务商并添加模型。你输入的内容已保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请先在「服务商」页面启用至少一个模型后再配置群成员。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
