          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请先在「服务商与设置」中添加并启用至少一个 OpenAI 兼容服务商（如 OpenAI、Groq、硅基流动或本地 Whisper/Kokoro）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add and enable at least one OpenAI-compatible provider (OpenAI, Groq, SiliconFlow, or local Whisper/Kokoro) in Providers first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先在「服务商与设置」中添加并启用至少一个 OpenAI 兼容服务商（如 OpenAI、Groq、硅基流动或本地 Whisper/Kokoro）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请先确认接收方并授权发送。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Confirm the recipients and grant permission before sending."
          }
